  "id": "conjunction-search",
  "term": "conjunction search",
  "definition": "Conjunction search is a visual search task in which a person must find a target defined by a combination of features, such as a red X among red O’s and green X’s. It is used to study how the visual system binds features belonging to the same object while avoiding mistaken combinations across different objects.",
